{"id":"51d7d0a29f3117c7","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/359_仿射类型论_Affine_Type_Theory.md","title":"359 仿射类型论 Affine Type Theory","display":"359_仿射类型论_Affine_Type_Theory","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"359-仿射类型论-Affine-Type-Theory\">359 仿射类型论 Affine Type Theory</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。固定可数无限变量集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}_{A}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}_{A}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span> 与可数基本类型集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Base}_{A}\">\\(\\mathsf{Base}_{A}\\)</span>。仿射上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ACtx}_{A}\">\\(\\mathsf{ACtx}_{A}\\)</span> 的元素是有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x:A\">\\(x:A\\)</span>，变量名不重复。上下文包含关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta&#39;\\preceq_A\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta&#39;\\preceq_A\\Delta\\)</span> 定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"dom(\\Delta&#39;)\\subseteq dom(\\Delta)\">\\(dom(\\Delta&#39;)\\subseteq dom(\\Delta)\\)</span> 且公共变量的类型声明一致。上下文分裂 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{A}\\Delta_2\\preceq_A\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{A}\\Delta_2\\preceq_A\\Delta\\)</span> 定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"dom(\\Delta_1)\\cap dom(\\Delta_2)=\\varnothing\">\\(dom(\\Delta_1)\\cap dom(\\Delta_2)=\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_1\\cup\\Delta_2\\preceq_A\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta_1\\cup\\Delta_2\\preceq_A\\Delta\\)</span>，且合并上下文保留二者全部声明。判断集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Jud}_{A}=\\{\n\\Delta\\vdash M:A.\n\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Jud}_{A}=\\{\n\\Delta\\vdash M:A.\n\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-类型与项\">2. 类型与项</h1>\n<p>类型集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_{A}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_{A}\\)</span> 是满足下列子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathsf{Base}_{A}\">\\(b\\in\\mathsf{Base}_{A}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{A}\">\\(b\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{A}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{A}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{A}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\multimap B\">\\(A\\multimap B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\otimes B\">\\(A\\otimes B\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\&amp;B\">\\(A\\&amp;B\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_{A}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_{A}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf 1\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{A}\">\\(\\mathbf 1\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{A}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}_{A}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}_{A}\\)</span> 是满足下列子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 是项。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是项且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{A}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{A}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^a x.M\">\\(\\lambda^a x.M\\)</span> 是项。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span> 是项，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"MN\">\\(MN\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\otimes N\">\\(M\\otimes N\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle M,N\\rangle_{\\&amp;}\">\\(\\langle M,N\\rangle_{\\&amp;}\\)</span> 是项。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span> 是项且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{A}\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{A}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{letTensor}(x,y,M,N)\">\\(\\mathsf{letTensor}(x,y,M,N)\\)</span> 是项。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是项，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{fst}_{\\&amp;}(M)\">\\(\\mathsf{fst}_{\\&amp;}(M)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{snd}_{\\&amp;}(M)\">\\(\\mathsf{snd}_{\\&amp;}(M)\\)</span> 是项。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\star\">\\(\\star\\)</span> 是项。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量与替换\">3. 自由变量与替换</h1>\n<p>自由变量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{A}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{A}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{A})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{A}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{A}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{A})\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(x)=\\{x\\},\\quad \\operatorname{FV}_{A}(\\lambda^a x.M)=\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(M)\\setminus\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(x)=\\{x\\},\\quad \\operatorname{FV}_{A}(\\lambda^a x.M)=\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(M)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(MN)=\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(M)\\cup \\operatorname{FV}_{A}(N),\\quad \\operatorname{FV}_{A}(M\\otimes N)=\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(M)\\cup \\operatorname{FV}_{A}(N),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(MN)=\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(M)\\cup \\operatorname{FV}_{A}(N),\\quad \\operatorname{FV}_{A}(M\\otimes N)=\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(M)\\cup \\operatorname{FV}_{A}(N),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(\\mathsf{letTensor}(x,y,M,N))=\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(M)\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(N)\\setminus\\{x,y\\}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(\\mathsf{letTensor}(x,y,M,N))=\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(M)\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(N)\\setminus\\{x,y\\}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(\\langle M,N\\rangle_{\\&amp;})=\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(M)\\cup \\operatorname{FV}_{A}(N),\\quad \\operatorname{FV}_{A}(\\mathsf{fst}_{\\&amp;}(M))=\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(M),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(\\langle M,N\\rangle_{\\&amp;})=\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(M)\\cup \\operatorname{FV}_{A}(N),\\quad \\operatorname{FV}_{A}(\\mathsf{fst}_{\\&amp;}(M))=\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(M),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(\\mathsf{snd}_{\\&amp;}(M))=\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(M),\\quad \\operatorname{FV}_{A}(\\star)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(\\mathsf{snd}_{\\&amp;}(M))=\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(M),\\quad \\operatorname{FV}_{A}(\\star)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定变量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{A}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{A}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{A})\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{A}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{A}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{A})\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{A}(x)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{A}(\\lambda^a x.M)=\\operatorname{BV}_{A}(M)\\cup\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{A}(x)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{A}(\\lambda^a x.M)=\\operatorname{BV}_{A}(M)\\cup\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{A}(\\mathsf{letTensor}(x,y,M,N))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{A}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{A}(N)\\cup\\{x,y\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{A}(\\mathsf{letTensor}(x,y,M,N))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{A}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{A}(N)\\cup\\{x,y\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且应用、张量、加性积、投影和单位项上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{A}\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{A}\\)</span> 取显示子项的并集。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{A}(X)=x_m\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}_{A}(X)=x_m\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:x_i\\notin X\\}\">\\(m=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:x_i\\notin X\\}\\)</span>。捕获避免替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{A}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{A}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{A}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{A}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{A}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{A}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{A}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{A}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{A}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{A}\\)</span> 由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BSub}_{A}(y,E,x,N)=\n\\begin{cases}\nE,&amp;y=x,\\\\\nE[x:=N],&amp;y\\ne x\\ \\wedge\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(N),\\\\\n(E[y:=z])[x:=N],&amp;y\\ne x\\ \\wedge\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(N),\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BSub}_{A}(y,E,x,N)=\n\\begin{cases}\nE,&amp;y=x,\\\\\nE[x:=N],&amp;y\\ne x\\ \\wedge\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(N),\\\\\n(E[y:=z])[x:=N],&amp;y\\ne x\\ \\wedge\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(N),\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>给出，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{A}(\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(E)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(N)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\">\\(z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{A}(\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(E)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(N)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\)</span>。因此</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\lambda^a y.M)[x:=N]=\\lambda^a y.\\operatorname{BSub}_{A}(y,M,x,N),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\lambda^a y.M)[x:=N]=\\lambda^a y.\\operatorname{BSub}_{A}(y,M,x,N),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{letTensor}(y,z,M_0,N_0)[x:=N]=\n\\mathsf{letTensor}(y,z,M_0[x:=N],\\operatorname{BSub}_{A}(z,\\operatorname{BSub}_{A}(y,N_0,x,N),x,N)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{letTensor}(y,z,M_0,N_0)[x:=N]=\n\\mathsf{letTensor}(y,z,M_0[x:=N],\\operatorname{BSub}_{A}(z,\\operatorname{BSub}_{A}(y,N_0,x,N),x,N)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{A}\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha^{A}\\)</span> 为所有满足下列条件的关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的交：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是等价关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^a\">\\(\\lambda^a\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{letTensor}\">\\(\\mathsf{letTensor}\\)</span> 的绑定改名对；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 对应用、张量、单位、加性积和投影构造子的同位置参数保持相容。</p>\n<p>项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 在上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 中可用的资源谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Live}_{A}(\\Delta,M)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{FV}_{A}(M)\\subseteq dom(\\Delta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Live}_{A}(\\Delta,M)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{FV}_{A}(M)\\subseteq dom(\\Delta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>资源丢弃关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Drop}_{A}(\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;,M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Delta&#39;\\preceq_A\\Delta\\land \\mathsf{Live}_{A}(\\Delta&#39;,M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Drop}_{A}(\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;,M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Delta&#39;\\preceq_A\\Delta\\land \\mathsf{Live}_{A}(\\Delta&#39;,M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>它只允许删除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 不自由使用的声明；因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Drop}_{A}\">\\(\\mathsf{Drop}_{A}\\)</span> 是仿射弱化的对象级逆向说明，而不是收缩。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-仿射类型规则\">4. 仿射类型规则</h1>\n<p>变量规则允许未使用其余上下文：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{x:A\\in\\Delta}{\\Delta\\vdash x:A}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{x:A\\in\\Delta}{\\Delta\\vdash x:A}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>弱化规则为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\Delta&#39;\\vdash M:A\\quad \\Delta&#39;\\preceq_A\\Delta}{\\Delta\\vdash M:A}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\\Delta&#39;\\vdash M:A\\quad \\Delta&#39;\\preceq_A\\Delta}{\\Delta\\vdash M:A}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>仿射函数规则为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\Delta,x:A\\vdash M:B}{\\Delta\\vdash \\lambda^a x.M:A\\multimap B}\n\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Delta_1\\vdash M:A\\multimap B\\quad \\Delta_2\\vdash N:A\\quad \\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{A}\\Delta_2\\preceq_A\\Delta}{\\Delta\\vdash MN:B}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\\Delta,x:A\\vdash M:B}{\\Delta\\vdash \\lambda^a x.M:A\\multimap B}\n\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Delta_1\\vdash M:A\\multimap B\\quad \\Delta_2\\vdash N:A\\quad \\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{A}\\Delta_2\\preceq_A\\Delta}{\\Delta\\vdash MN:B}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>张量规则为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\Delta_1\\vdash M:A\\quad \\Delta_2\\vdash N:B\\quad \\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{A}\\Delta_2\\preceq_A\\Delta}{\\Delta\\vdash M\\otimes N:A\\otimes B},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\\Delta_1\\vdash M:A\\quad \\Delta_2\\vdash N:B\\quad \\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{A}\\Delta_2\\preceq_A\\Delta}{\\Delta\\vdash M\\otimes N:A\\otimes B},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\Delta_1\\vdash M:A\\otimes B\\quad \\Delta_2,x:A,y:B\\vdash N:C\\quad \\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{A}\\Delta_2\\preceq_A\\Delta}{\\Delta\\vdash \\mathsf{letTensor}(x,y,M,N):C}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\\Delta_1\\vdash M:A\\otimes B\\quad \\Delta_2,x:A,y:B\\vdash N:C\\quad \\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{A}\\Delta_2\\preceq_A\\Delta}{\\Delta\\vdash \\mathsf{letTensor}(x,y,M,N):C}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>单位规则为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{}{\\Delta\\vdash \\star:\\mathbf 1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{}{\\Delta\\vdash \\star:\\mathbf 1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>加性积规则为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\Delta\\vdash M:A\\quad \\Delta\\vdash N:B}{\\Delta\\vdash \\langle M,N\\rangle_{\\&amp;}:A\\&amp;B},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\\Delta\\vdash M:A\\quad \\Delta\\vdash N:B}{\\Delta\\vdash \\langle M,N\\rangle_{\\&amp;}:A\\&amp;B},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\Delta\\vdash M:A\\&amp;B}{\\Delta\\vdash \\mathsf{fst}_{\\&amp;}(M):A}\n\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Delta\\vdash M:A\\&amp;B}{\\Delta\\vdash \\mathsf{snd}_{\\&amp;}(M):B}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\\Delta\\vdash M:A\\&amp;B}{\\Delta\\vdash \\mathsf{fst}_{\\&amp;}(M):A}\n\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Delta\\vdash M:A\\&amp;B}{\\Delta\\vdash \\mathsf{snd}_{\\&amp;}(M):B}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>没有收缩规则；同一变量不得被两个前提同时使用，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbin{\\#}\">\\(\\mathbin{\\#}\\)</span> 要求域不交。</p>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{A}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Jud}_{A}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Jud}_{A}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{A}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Jud}_{A}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Jud}_{A}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为下列关系族的并：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{VarRule}_{A}=\\{((),(\\Delta\\vdash x:A)):x:A\\in\\Delta\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{VarRule}_{A}=\\{((),(\\Delta\\vdash x:A)):x:A\\in\\Delta\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{WeakRule}_{A}=\\{(((\\Delta&#39;\\vdash M:A)),(\\Delta\\vdash M:A)):\\Delta&#39;\\preceq_A\\Delta\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{WeakRule}_{A}=\\{(((\\Delta&#39;\\vdash M:A)),(\\Delta\\vdash M:A)):\\Delta&#39;\\preceq_A\\Delta\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DropRule}_{A}=\\{(((\\Delta\\vdash M:A)),(\\Delta&#39;\\vdash M:A)):\\mathsf{Drop}_{A}(\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;,M)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{DropRule}_{A}=\\{(((\\Delta\\vdash M:A)),(\\Delta&#39;\\vdash M:A)):\\mathsf{Drop}_{A}(\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;,M)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LamRule}_{A}=\\{(((\\Delta,x:A\\vdash M:B)),(\\Delta\\vdash \\lambda^a x.M:A\\multimap B))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{LamRule}_{A}=\\{(((\\Delta,x:A\\vdash M:B)),(\\Delta\\vdash \\lambda^a x.M:A\\multimap B))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AppRule}_{A}=\\{(((\\Delta_1\\vdash M:A\\multimap B),(\\Delta_2\\vdash N:A)),(\\Delta\\vdash MN:B)):\n\\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{A}\\Delta_2\\preceq_A\\Delta\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AppRule}_{A}=\\{(((\\Delta_1\\vdash M:A\\multimap B),(\\Delta_2\\vdash N:A)),(\\Delta\\vdash MN:B)):\n\\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{A}\\Delta_2\\preceq_A\\Delta\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TensorI}_{A}\">\\(\\mathsf{TensorI}_{A}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TensorE}_{A}\">\\(\\mathsf{TensorE}_{A}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{UnitRule}_{A}\">\\(\\mathsf{UnitRule}_{A}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{WithI}_{A}\">\\(\\mathsf{WithI}_{A}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{WithE1}_{A}\">\\(\\mathsf{WithE1}_{A}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{WithE2}_{A}\">\\(\\mathsf{WithE2}_{A}\\)</span> 的元素分别由本节显示的张量、单位和加性积规则的前提列、结论与分裂侧条件组成。没有任何元素形如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(((\\Delta,x:A,x:A\\vdash M:B)),(\\Delta,x:A\\vdash M:B))\">\\((((\\Delta,x:A,x:A\\vdash M:B)),(\\Delta,x:A\\vdash M:B))\\)</span>，因此收缩不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{A}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{A}\\)</span> 的成员。</p>\n<p>完整规则关系取</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{A}=\\mathsf{VarRule}_{A}\\cup\\mathsf{WeakRule}_{A}\\cup\\mathsf{DropRule}_{A}\\cup\\mathsf{LamRule}_{A}\\cup\\mathsf{AppRule}_{A}\\cup\\mathsf{TensorI}_{A}\\cup\\mathsf{TensorE}_{A}\\cup\\mathsf{UnitRule}_{A}\\cup\\mathsf{WithI}_{A}\\cup\\mathsf{WithE1}_{A}\\cup\\mathsf{WithE2}_{A}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{A}=\\mathsf{VarRule}_{A}\\cup\\mathsf{WeakRule}_{A}\\cup\\mathsf{DropRule}_{A}\\cup\\mathsf{LamRule}_{A}\\cup\\mathsf{AppRule}_{A}\\cup\\mathsf{TensorI}_{A}\\cup\\mathsf{TensorE}_{A}\\cup\\mathsf{UnitRule}_{A}\\cup\\mathsf{WithI}_{A}\\cup\\mathsf{WithE1}_{A}\\cup\\mathsf{WithE2}_{A}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-归约与推导\">5. 归约与推导</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to^0_A\">\\(\\to^0_A\\)</span> 包含：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\lambda^a x.M)N\\to_A M[N/x],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\lambda^a x.M)N\\to_A M[N/x],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{letTensor}(x,y,M\\otimes N,P)\\to_A P[M/x][N/y],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{letTensor}(x,y,M\\otimes N,P)\\to_A P[M/x][N/y],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{fst}_{\\&amp;}(\\langle M,N\\rangle_{\\&amp;})\\to_A M,\\qquad \\mathsf{snd}_{\\&amp;}(\\langle M,N\\rangle_{\\&amp;})\\to_A N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{fst}_{\\&amp;}(\\langle M,N\\rangle_{\\&amp;})\\to_A M,\\qquad \\mathsf{snd}_{\\&amp;}(\\langle M,N\\rangle_{\\&amp;})\\to_A N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>根规约分解为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Red}^{\\beta}_{A}=\\{((\\lambda^a x.M)N,M[N/x]):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{A},\\ M,N\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{A}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Red}^{\\beta}_{A}=\\{((\\lambda^a x.M)N,M[N/x]):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{A},\\ M,N\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{A}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Red}^{\\otimes}_{A}=\\{(\\mathsf{letTensor}(x,y,M\\otimes N,P),P[M/x][N/y]):x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{A},\\ M,N,P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{A}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Red}^{\\otimes}_{A}=\\{(\\mathsf{letTensor}(x,y,M\\otimes N,P),P[M/x][N/y]):x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{A},\\ M,N,P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{A}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Red}^{\\&amp;}_{A}=\\{(\\mathsf{fst}_{\\&amp;}(\\langle M,N\\rangle_{\\&amp;}),M),(\\mathsf{snd}_{\\&amp;}(\\langle M,N\\rangle_{\\&amp;}),N):M,N\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{A}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Red}^{\\&amp;}_{A}=\\{(\\mathsf{fst}_{\\&amp;}(\\langle M,N\\rangle_{\\&amp;}),M),(\\mathsf{snd}_{\\&amp;}(\\langle M,N\\rangle_{\\&amp;}),N):M,N\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{A}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规约一孔上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{A}\">\\(\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{A}\\)</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> 以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^a x.C\">\\(\\lambda^a x.C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"CP\">\\(CP\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PC\">\\(PC\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\otimes P\">\\(C\\otimes P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\otimes C\">\\(P\\otimes C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{letTensor}(x,y,C,P)\">\\(\\mathsf{letTensor}(x,y,C,P)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{letTensor}(x,y,P,C)\">\\(\\mathsf{letTensor}(x,y,P,C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle C,P\\rangle_{\\&amp;}\">\\(\\langle C,P\\rangle_{\\&amp;}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle P,C\\rangle_{\\&amp;}\">\\(\\langle P,C\\rangle_{\\&amp;}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{fst}_{\\&amp;}(C)\">\\(\\mathsf{fst}_{\\&amp;}(C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{snd}_{\\&amp;}(C)\">\\(\\mathsf{snd}_{\\&amp;}(C)\\)</span> 闭合生成。一步归约定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M\\to_A N\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists C,P,Q\\,\n(C\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{A}\\land (P,Q)\\in\\to^0_A\\land M=C[P]\\land N=C[Q]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M\\to_A N\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists C,P,Q\\,\n(C\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{A}\\land (P,Q)\\in\\to^0_A\\land M=C[P]\\land N=C[Q]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>ATT 推导树是有限有根树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 与标记函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Jud}_{A}\">\\(\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Jud}_{A}\\)</span>，每个节点的直接子节点标记列和该节点标记组成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{A}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{A}\\)</span> 的一个元素。若存在根标记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\vdash M:A\">\\(\\Delta\\vdash M:A\\)</span> 的推导树，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\vdash_A M:A\">\\(\\Delta\\vdash_A M:A\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>初始判断族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{A}\n=\n\\{\\varnothing\\vdash b\\ \\mathsf{type}:b\\in\\mathsf{Base}_{A}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\Delta\\vdash x:A:x:A\\in\\Delta\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{A}\n=\n\\{\\varnothing\\vdash b\\ \\mathsf{type}:b\\in\\mathsf{Base}_{A}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\Delta\\vdash x:A:x:A\\in\\Delta\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>ATT 推导树的叶节点必须属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{A}\">\\(\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{A}\\)</span> 或由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{A}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{A}\\)</span> 的零前提规则实例给出。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Der}_{A}\n=\n\\{(T,r,\\ell):T\\text{ 是非空有限有根树},r\\in T,\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Jud}_{A},\n\\text{ 且每个节点的子节点列与节点标记属于 }\\mathsf{Rule}_{A}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Der}_{A}\n=\n\\{(T,r,\\ell):T\\text{ 是非空有限有根树},r\\in T,\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Jud}_{A},\n\\text{ 且每个节点的子节点列与节点标记属于 }\\mathsf{Rule}_{A}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标差异对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{A}\n=\n(\\preceq_A,\\mathbin{\\#}_{A},\\mathsf{Drop}_{A},\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{A},\\multimap,\\otimes,\\mathbf 1,\\&amp;,\\to^0_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{A}\n=\n(\\preceq_A,\\mathbin{\\#}_{A},\\mathsf{Drop}_{A},\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{A},\\multimap,\\otimes,\\mathbf 1,\\&amp;,\\to^0_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_A\">\\(\\preceq_A\\)</span> 允许未使用资源的弱化，且没有收缩规则。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-仿射资源证书\">6. 仿射资源证书</h1>\n<p>仿射 usage algebra 为偏代数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb U_A=(\\{0,1\\},0,\\oplus_A,\\le_A),qquad\n0\\oplus_Au=u\\oplus_A0=u,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb U_A=(\\{0,1\\},0,\\oplus_A,\\le_A),qquad\n0\\oplus_Au=u\\oplus_A0=u,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\oplus_A1\">\\(1\\oplus_A1\\)</span> 未定义，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\le_A1\">\\(0\\le_A1\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Use}_{A}(M)(x)=\n\\begin{cases}1,&amp;x\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(M),\\\\0,&amp;x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(M).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Use}_{A}(M)(x)=\n\\begin{cases}1,&amp;x\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(M),\\\\0,&amp;x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(M).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>上下文分裂的可计算刻画为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{A}\\Delta_2\\preceq_A\\Delta\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Delta)\\ \n\\chi_{\\Delta_1}(x)\\oplus_A\\chi_{\\Delta_2}(x)\n\\text{ 有定义且 }\\le_A\\chi_\\Delta(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{A}\\Delta_2\\preceq_A\\Delta\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Delta)\\ \n\\chi_{\\Delta_1}(x)\\oplus_A\\chi_{\\Delta_2}(x)\n\\text{ 有定义且 }\\le_A\\chi_\\Delta(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SplitCert}_{A}(\\Delta,\\Delta_1,\\Delta_2)\">\\(\\mathsf{SplitCert}_{A}(\\Delta,\\Delta_1,\\Delta_2)\\)</span> 为逐变量列出上述偏加法计算的有限表；应用和张量规则的侧条件只在该证书非空时成立。因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\oplus_A1\">\\(1\\oplus_A1\\)</span> 未定义，同一声明不能进入两个前提。</p>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DropCert}_{A}(\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;,M)\">\\(\\mathsf{DropCert}_{A}(\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;,M)\\)</span> 为有限声明表，每个被删除声明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x:B\">\\(x:B\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(M)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{A}(M)\\)</span>，每个保留声明在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;\">\\(\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;\\)</span> 中类型相同。于是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Drop}_{A}(\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;,M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists C\\in\\mathsf{DropCert}_{A}(\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;,M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Drop}_{A}(\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;,M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists C\\in\\mathsf{DropCert}_{A}(\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;,M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>不存在把一个声明映到两个保留位置的证书，故收缩不能由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DropRule}_{A}\">\\(\\mathsf{DropRule}_{A}\\)</span> 派生。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-有限证明与可导性\">7. 有限证明与可导性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\vdash_A M:B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists(T,r,\\ell)\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{A}\\ (\\ell(r)=\\Delta\\vdash M:B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta\\vdash_A M:B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists(T,r,\\ell)\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{A}\\ (\\ell(r)=\\Delta\\vdash M:B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证明树的弱化节点携带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DropCert}_{A}\">\\(\\mathsf{DropCert}_{A}\\)</span>，其他节点匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{A}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{A}\\)</span> 的有序前提列。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-整个形式系统\">8. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{ATT}=(\\mathsf{Var}_{A},\\mathsf{Base}_{A},\\mathsf{Ty}_{A},\\mathsf{Tm}_{A},\\mathsf{ACtx}_{A},\n\\mathbb U_A,\\oplus_A,\\operatorname{Use}_{A},\\mathsf{SplitCert}_{A},\\mathsf{DropCert}_{A},\n\\preceq_A,\\mathbin{\\#}_{A},\\mathsf{Live}_{A},\\mathsf{Drop}_{A},\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{A},\\operatorname{FV}_{A},\\operatorname{BV}_{A},\\operatorname{Sub}_{A},\\equiv_\\alpha^{A},\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{A},\\mathsf{Delta}_{A},\\mathsf{Jud}_{A},\\mathsf{Rule}_{A},\\mathsf{Der}_{A},\\to^0_A,\\to_A,\\vdash_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{ATT}=(\\mathsf{Var}_{A},\\mathsf{Base}_{A},\\mathsf{Ty}_{A},\\mathsf{Tm}_{A},\\mathsf{ACtx}_{A},\n\\mathbb U_A,\\oplus_A,\\operatorname{Use}_{A},\\mathsf{SplitCert}_{A},\\mathsf{DropCert}_{A},\n\\preceq_A,\\mathbin{\\#}_{A},\\mathsf{Live}_{A},\\mathsf{Drop}_{A},\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{A},\\operatorname{FV}_{A},\\operatorname{BV}_{A},\\operatorname{Sub}_{A},\\equiv_\\alpha^{A},\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{A},\\mathsf{Delta}_{A},\\mathsf{Jud}_{A},\\mathsf{Rule}_{A},\\mathsf{Der}_{A},\\to^0_A,\\to_A,\\vdash_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"8.1-完成核对\">8.1 完成核对</h2>\n<p>本文把仿射性写成弱化规则和无收缩约束，给出上下文包含、上下文分裂、自由变量、替换、初始判断族、目标差异、类型规则、推导对象、归约和最终元组；不含解释结构或满足关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"359-仿射类型论-Affine-Type-Theory","text":"359 仿射类型论 Affine Type Theory","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-类型与项","text":"2. 类型与项","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量与替换","text":"3. 自由变量与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-仿射类型规则","text":"4. 仿射类型规则","level":1},{"id":"5.-归约与推导","text":"5. 归约与推导","level":1},{"id":"6.-仿射资源证书","text":"6. 仿射资源证书","level":1},{"id":"7.-有限证明与可导性","text":"7. 有限证明与可导性","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个形式系统","text":"8. 整个形式系统","level":1},{"id":"8.1-完成核对","text":"8.1 完成核对","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}_{A}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Base}_{A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{ACtx}_{A}","display":false},{"tex":"x:A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta'\\preceq_A\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"dom(\\Delta')\\subseteq dom(\\Delta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{A}\\Delta_2\\preceq_A\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"dom(\\Delta_1)\\cap dom(\\Delta_2)=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_1\\cup\\Delta_2\\preceq_A\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Jud}_{A}=\\{\n\\Delta\\vdash M:A.\n\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_{A}","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\mathsf{Base}_{A}","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{A}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{A}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\multimap B","display":false},{"tex":"A\\otimes B","display":false},{"tex":"A\\&B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_{A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf 1\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tm}_{A}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda^a x.M","display":false},{"tex":"M,N","display":false},{"tex":"MN","display":false},{"tex":"M\\otimes N","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle M,N\\rangle_{\\&}","display":false},{"t